flowchart TB
  Client[HTTP or HTTPS client] --> Proxy[Local proxy and inspection]
  Proxy --> Decision[Rules and Halt]
  Decision -->|Allow| Origin[Origin server]
  Decision -->|Block| Reject[Local 403]
  Decision <--> Runtime[application.Runtime]
  Runtime <--> SQLite[(Local SQLite)]
  Origin -->|Stream counters| Runtime
  Proxy -->|Observed IP| Geo[Offline country MMDB]
  Geo --> Runtime
  Runtime <--> API[Shared snapshot, REST and WebSocket]
  API <--> UI[Dashboard and offline map]
